1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,206
One rule links the ruler,
the rate law, and

2
00:00:04,206 --> 00:00:07,640
the curve: add inputs, multiply outputs.

3
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:10,680
The exponential is the forward machine.

4
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:14,600
But what if we know the output and ask for
the input?

5
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:16,620
That is the logarithm.

6
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:19,900
On the real number line it works
beautifully.

7
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:24,440
On a circle, the same destination can hide
more than one journey.

